      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>ImageDigestMirrorSet holds cluster-wide information about how to handle registry mirror rules on using digest pull specification. When multiple policies are defined, the outcome of the behavior is defined on each field.</p>
      <p>Compatibility level 1: Stable within a major release for a minimum of 12 months or 3 minor releases (whichever is longer).</p>
